* Crypto hacks 2019
** Figures
*** Chainalysis: 11 exchange hacks, ~$283M
*** CipherTrace: ~$371M thefts, ~$4.1B fraud
*** SlowMist: 111 incidents, only 9 priced
** Exchanges
*** CoinBene ~$105M (denied), Upbit ~$49M
*** Binance 7,074 BTC (API keys, 2FA codes)
*** BITPoint, Bithumb, Cryptopia, GateHub
*** Lazarus: DragonEx, Upbit (2024 attribution)
** EOS and Tron DApps
*** Congestion, rollback, fake EOS
*** Fake notifications, weak random numbers
** Chains and users
*** ETC and Vertcoin 51% attacks
*** NULS, Fusion, VeChain
*** Electrum, npm supply chain, SIM swaps
** Not counted
*** Frauds: PlusToken, WoToken, QuadrigaCX
*** Accidents: Kraken flash crash, Synthetix oracle
